t title."}, {"lit": "of Gaeltacht", "meaning": "Gaeltacht: Irish-speaking area (genitive: Gaeltachta)", "ctx": "Part of the Department title."}, {"lit": "will be", "meaning": "bí: to be (future: beidh)", "ctx": "Starts a future statement about Culture Night."}, {"lit": "Night", "meaning": "oíche: night", "ctx": "Part of the title Oíche Chultúir."}, {"lit": "of Culture", "meaning": "cultúr: culture (genitive, lenited: chultúir)", "ctx": "Completes the title Culture Night."}, {"lit": "of the", "meaning": "an: the (genitive feminine singular: na)", "ctx": "Marks bliana as genitive: of the year."}, {"lit": "year", "meaning": "bliain: year (genitive: bliana)", "ctx": "Specifies this year's Culture Night."}, {"lit": "this", "meaning": "seo: this", "ctx": "Points to the current year."}, {"lit": "on", "meaning": "ar: on", "ctx": "Part of the phrase ar siúl."}, {"lit": "going", "meaning": "siúl: walking, going", "ctx": "In ar siúl, meaning taking place."}, {"lit": "on day", "meaning": "Dé: day of, on day", "ctx": "Used before a weekday in dates."}, {"lit": "Friday", "meaning": "Aoine: Friday (with h-prefix: hAoine)", "ctx": "Names the day of the week."}, {"lit": "this", "meaning": "seo: this", "ctx": "Modifies Friday in the date phrase."}, {"lit": "towards us", "meaning": "chugainn: to us, towards us", "ctx": "In seo chugainn, meaning next or coming."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the", "ctx": "Introduces the date."}, {"lit": "first", "meaning": "aonú: first (with t-prefix: t-aonú)", "ctx": "Part of the ordinal date."}, {"lit": "day", "meaning": "lá: day", "ctx": "Names the day in the date."}, {"lit": "and", "meaning": "is: and, plus", "ctx": "Links one and twenty in the number."}, {"lit": "twenty", "meaning": "fiche: twenty", "ctx": "Completes twenty-first."}, {"lit": "of", "meaning": "de: of, from", "ctx": "Introduces the month."}, {"lit": "middle", "meaning": "meán: middle (lenited: Mheán)", "ctx": "Part of the month name September."}, {"lit": "of autumn", "meaning": "